<slide>
  heading-size: 72
  text-size: 28
  spacing: 26
  padding: 8vmin 12vmin
  accent: #ffb454
</slide>

<h2>Sizes and spacing</h2>

<p>Slide settings: shorthands for the most common knobs:</p>

<ul>
  <li><c>heading-size: 72</c> and <c>text-size: 28</c> (plain numbers are pixels)</li>
  <li><c>spacing: 26</c> — the gap between text blocks</li>
  <li><c>padding: 8vmin 12vmin</c> — the slide's inner margin</li>
  <li><c>accent: #ffb454</c>, <c>heading-color</c>, <c>text-color</c> — colors for this slide</li>
</ul>

<notes>
  Any CSS length works: 4vmin, 2rem, 30px. The same keys work in "defaults" in deck.json.
</notes>
